      "title": "Modes · Pruned native / LightX2V8",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Mode controls\n- Default 8-step: LightX2V Power Loader row ON and Acceleration Boolean ON. Euler + Simple 8 steps, video/audio shift 12/3.\n- Fallback Pruned native 20-step: ALL LoRA rows OFF and Acceleration Boolean OFF. `res_multistep + beta + 20 steps`.\n- Boolean switches MODEL, SAMPLER and SIGMAS but does NOT toggle LoRA row. Both controls must agree.\n- Pruned native fallback remains Pruned, not Full. Import the separate historical Full workflow for Full/BF16 production quality comparison.\n- Shift 12/3 is a candidate configuration for Ref2VA 8-step v1.1, not a validated best setting."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Mode controls\n- Default 8-step: LightX2V Power Loader row ON and Acceleration Boolean ON. Euler + Simple 8 steps, video/audio shift 12/3.\n- Fallback Pruned native 20-step: ALL LoRA rows OFF and Acceleration Boolean OFF. `res_multistep + beta + 20 steps`.\n- Boolean switches MODEL, SAMPLER and SIGMAS but does NOT toggle LoRA row. Both controls must agree.\n- Pruned native fallback remains Pruned, not Full. Import the separate historical Full workflow for Full/BF16 production quality comparison.\n- Shift 12/3 is a candidate configuration for Ref2VA 8-step v1.1, not a validated best setting."
      }
    },
